Decision `ec7c56fe` by coordinator `local_185c1aeb-4ba5-4bab-8b8c-e42993c85a29` of Feature #1940 for #1974. Authority: the orchestrate-feature invocation, quoted verbatim from the run record: "C:/Program Files/Git/orchestrate-feature #1940"

